"A blobref's offset, an `int`, where an `i64` is expected: refused, as
 Fixpt refuses it; a blobref's reading forms are compared with what is
 expected, as any form is (C175)."
(define-effect kfx (maxeff (read @globals) (alloc @heap) spin))
(define-type blob (bloblet (fields) @heap))
(define main (subr kfx () i64)
  (lambda ()
    (blobref-offset (the (blobref blob i64) (blobref-at (the blob (make-bloblet 16)) 0)))))
